OL,3,GNEWSAMayor defects from Greens after
OL,4,AZionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the Green Party on
OL,7,FCornwall Council has defected following
OL,8,Fthe party's recent "Zionism is racism"
OL,9,Fmotion.
OL,11,FDrew Creek joined the Labour and
OL,12,FCo-operatives on Thursday after the
OL,13,Fpolicy motion was passed at the Green
OL,14,FParty's conference earlier this month.
OL,16,FCreek, who is Mayor of Newquay and
OL,17,Fserves as a councillor for Trenance
OL,18,Fward, said he had "huge respect" for
OL,19,FGreens across Cornwall but the motion
OL,20,F"crossed a line".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
