OL,3,GNEWSAMayor defects from Greens after
OL,4,AZionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Cornwall Green Party said it was
OL,7,F"deeply saddened" by Creek's decision
OL,8,Fto join Labour and said it does not
OL,9,F"try to impose uniformity of belief"
OL,10,Famong its members and elected
OL,11,Frepresentatives.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
